\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0   Lift you high Jesus Christ our Lord
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj  that you came down like man to us
\par  young Mary brought him forth as man
\par  That men and all angels rejoice
\par  Halleluiah!
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.   The only son of the Godhead
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0  is lying in a stable
\par  Jesus Christ our Lord came to us
\par \pard\li144\sl190\slmult0   in flesh and blood just like us all.
\par    Hallelujah!\tab 
\par 
\par \pard\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.   He who the whole world can't contain
\par \pard\li144\sl190\slmult0\qj  is lying in the arms of Mary
\par  He who holds up all things in his hand
\par  even became a little child.
\par  Hallelujah!
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
